{"id":1061302,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅱ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"霁川·审查Ⅱ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1061302]}],"trial":{"trial_id":61302,"stage":"阶段2","unlock_time":"2026-05-07 14:00:00","diary1":"前往东洲的路很长，足够你回顾你跟霁川短暂的相识。你克制着回望的频次，生怕这趟奔赴终会落成空影。\n　　唯一让路途保持真实的，是枷锁另一端那缕似有若无的跳动。它如此微弱，却始终未断，如同深雪之下传来的脉搏，证明着彼端仍有生命在呼吸，仍有执念未曾沉寂。","diary2":"没有重逢的寒暄，也没有生死的感怀。你见到霁川时，她只是躺在那里，尚有呼吸，但却极其微弱。\n　　你必须尽快进入她的精神图景，那里正在崩解。你得找到她，在她的意识彻底溃散之前，将她重新带回此岸。","evidence":[{"ID":260899,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260900,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":161302023,"next":null},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":16130202